{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は開運音楽堂の収録に\n行ってきました♡\nみさみさがいたので\n楽しく収録出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに赤萩さん9nineのうっきーさん\nベイビーレイズのなおすけさんも\n一緒にお仕事が出来て\n楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回目の放送日は3/2( •ㅈ• )\n3/9 3/16にも出るので\nふぁみたんは要チェック！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして新衣装の写メを\nぶろぐに載せて。と言われて\nたので公開しちゃいます( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/19/6245570/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってるといいんだが...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日もライブリハ\nこれから頑張ってきます( •ㅈ• )\n楽しみにしててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/02/19/6245570/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手乗りみさみさ発売中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、只今売り切れました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}